      "raw": "<p>I&#39;m in the process of redesigning the Character Appearances page, and am done with the heroes sections. I thought I&#39;d let everyone know because what I did was each hero tab now has the appearances of characters in their deck and power cards, plus where they appear in every other deck.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>This will make it easier for all you people with enterprising questions to figure out where, say, Argent Adept appears in every deck, so you can go look at the art and ask questions based on it as you wish.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>the two pages are linked from the Character Appearances page for now, but here are the direct links</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>http://sentinelswiki.com/index.php?title=Character/A-M</p><p>http://sentinelswiki.com/index.php?title=Character/N-Z</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Just for example, because Unity is coming up soon, here are all the cards and decks that Unity appears on.:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><ul style=\"margin-top: 0.3em; margin-left: 1.6em; list-style-image: url(&quot;data:image/svg+xml,%3C%3Fxml%20version%3D%221.0%22%20encoding%3D%22UTF-8%22%3F%3E%0A%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20version%3D%221.1%22%20width%3D%225%22%20height%3D%2213%22%3E%0A%3Ccircle%20cx%3D%222.5%22%20cy%3D%229.5%22%20r%3D%222.5%22%20fill%3D%22%2300528c%22%2F%3E%0A%3C%2Fsvg%3E%0A&quot;); color: rgb(54, 43, 54); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(242, 245, 247);\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0.1em;\"><a class=\"new\" href=\"http://sentinelswiki.com/index.php?title=The_Freedom_Tower&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" style=\"color: rgb(165, 88, 88); background-image: none;\" title=\"The Freedom Tower (page does not exist)\">The Freedom Tower</a>&nbsp;- Caspit&#39;s &quot;Playground&quot;</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0.1em;\"><a href=\"http://sentinelswiki.com/index.php?title=Magmaria\" style=\"color: rgb(11, 0, 128); background-image: none;\" title=\"Magmaria\">Magmaria</a>&nbsp;- Magmarian Throng</li><li style=