"Baron Blade\">Baron Blade</a>&nbsp;Tactics - Regression Burst (Promo)</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0.1em;\"><a href=\"http://sentinelswiki.com/index.php?title=Sergeant_Steel\" style=\"color: rgb(11, 0, 128); background-image: none;\" title=\"Sergeant Steel\">Sergeant Steel</a>&nbsp;- Mission Objective</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0.1em;\"><a href=\"http://sentinelswiki.com/index.php?title=Wager_Master\" style=\"color: rgb(11, 0, 128); background-image: none;\" title=\"Wager Master\">Wager Master</a>&nbsp;- A Burning Sense of Failure</li></ul><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0.1em;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0.1em;\">I haven&#39;t got to any of the villain pages &nbsp;yet, so there is still work to be done, and I did it quick and dirty for now so there are some inconsistencies (ie, the order in which things are organized, just using &#39;Team Style Villain&#39; and &#39;Tactics&#39; to deliniate different decks with similiar names, something I want to do in a better way later) but its a good resource for getting more pointed story questions in. Good luck in asking great questions everyone!</p>",
